OL,3,GNEWSALife-size dinosaur sculptures
OL,4,Adisplayed at palace
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive colourful dinosaur sculptures have
OL,7,Fbeen installed in the gardens of a
OL,8,Fpalace.
OL,10,FThe Megalosaurus is displayed in
OL,11,Fdifferent expressive poses in the
OL,12,FDinosaurs Are Forever exhibition at
OL,13,FBlenheim Palace in Woodstock,
OL,14,FOxfordshire.
OL,16,FIt was the first ever scientifically
OL,17,Fnamed dinosaur, discovered in a quarry
OL,18,Fin Stonesfield about five miles (7.5km)
OL,19,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
