OL,3,GNEWSALife-size dinosaur sculptures
OL,4,Adisplayed at palace
OL,5,
OL,6,FJay Jay Burridge of Future Fossils, who
OL,7,Fput the exhibition together in
OL,8,Fpartnership with the Oxford University
OL,9,FMuseum of Natural History, said the
OL,10,Fdisplays were made by foam manufacturer
OL,11,FZotefoams with a "hot air gun, then
OL,12,Fcarved by hand with large chef's
OL,13,Fknives".
